    number: "151",
    slug: "leonidas",
    path: "151-leonidas",
    title: "Martyr Leonidas of Constantinople",
    description: "Commemorated on August 8 The Martyrs Leonidas and Eleutherius, along with many infants, were cast into a fire at a youthful age during one of the persecutions against Christians.",
